From 35fcf8265911406cad4964ef5cf321fd582c6b89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Apr 2026 23:14:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(phase 2): SMS speed-to-response + review-ask + env chart
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Closes Phase 2 Twilio milestone. Two automated SMS paths, both gated on
isTwilioConfigured() — no-op silently until env vars land.

- notifyNewLead: fire-and-forget Twilio SMS to the lead after email + push;
  shared by website form + FB Lead Ads + Messenger DMs. <160 GSM-7 chars
  for 1-segment cost. Logs failures, never blocks lead insert.
- /api/customers/[id]/review action=asked: sends review-ask SMS alongside
  the DB stamp. DB stamp lands even if SMS fails. Outcome returned in
  response payload; ReviewActions surfaces failure reasons inline.
- .env.example: added Twilio trio, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, Meta webhook trio,
  QBO_ENVIRONMENT, SETUP_KEY, GOOGLE_REVIEW_URL with provisioning notes
  + [REQUIRED]/[OPTIONAL] legend. Removed unused VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY.
- Fix: nowMs() infinite recursion in ReviewSection (latent — would have
  crashed /hq/customers/[id] the moment the new ask flow ran).
